{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1355-mummy-the-curse-pbp-a-curse-upon-paris-discussion-thread","id":1355,"title":"Mummy: The Curse - PBP - A Curse Upon Paris - Discussion Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-02T16:15:16-07:00","id":1355,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon14.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Mummy: The Curse - PBP - A Curse Upon Paris - Discussion Thread","content":"-<br /> <i>Among the cities of Europe, Paris shines more brightly than any other as a beacon of dramatic history, vibrant culture and exciting future. It is a city imbued with life. Each individual to have passed through or dwelt in La <span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Ville</span></span><span style=\"color:#444444\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">-Lumi\u00e8re</span></span> knows that moreso than any other metropolitan hub, Paris is a city rich with emotion. Memories of romance, terror, gaiety and war are carved in to the cobbled streets, the ornate pillars and walls, the decadent monuments and calcified banks of the Seine, never to fade. They will always act as a reminder to Parisians of what joys and sorrows memorialise the history of this great capital.<br /> <br /> Perhaps the greatest of spiritual gouges in the beating heart of Paris are the catacombs cut beneath the city housing six million or so dead. At first a common burial pit, then a cemetery, an extended mausoleum, a colossal tomb of earth and finally the vast expanse of the catacombs existing today. A small piece of the network beneath the city is now a tourist attraction. Most of it is however inaccessible due to the dangers of such old tunnels in such soft ground.<br /> <br /> At least, that's the reason given to the populace.<br /> <br /> The truth concealed from all but few is how some of those tunnels are still in a sense, inhabited. Several entities rest in the vast necropolis of Paris, waiting for the time that their masters or followers give them cause to wake. They have rested there for many decades, and the city above has changed greatly since last they descended.<br /> <br /> Shortly they will rise again, and Paris will find itself cursed by their presence.<br /> <br /> -</i><br /> <br /> Okay, so this is the first brainstorm post in the PBP (play-by-post) thread for Claire, Egg and Scutarii, who will all be players in this introductory game of Mummy: The Curse.<br /> <br /> I would like to advise all three players that it would make sense from a newcomer's perspective to each take on the role of a Mummy, but if any of the players wish to play as a Sadikh or cultist then I am amenable to that should you have a character concept in mind.<br /> <br /> Please post character ideas here, bearing in mind the lack of known history your character will possess at game commencement. I'm looking for concepts mainly, including ingrained thoughts, philosophies, likes, dislikes, Guilds, Judges and Decrees. In tabletop style it would be excellent if you bounced ideas off of one another to make for an interesting band of Arisen. Say what you want to play, and if you have any difficulty making that character with what you know, either I or one of the other players should be able to put you on the right track. It's a versatile enough game that any character is pretty much possible.<br /> <br /> Once we've got some character concepts in mind, the character sheets on Mr. Gone's website can not only be used but also attached to comments within this thread, allowing for ease of reference. At that point, I will set up a new thread for gameplay.<br /> <br /> Let's get Cursing!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":152,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","user":"The Gentleman Gamer","date":". 11-02-2013, 07:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T16:52:09-07:00","id":1382,"title":"","content":"My character is to be somewhat like Lara Croft as a mummy. I'm still deciding on the various factors here, like Guild and Judge and Decree, and should have some more details before too long.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T19:03:04-07:00","id":1439,"title":"","content":"I'm impressively new to Mummy, so if I get anything wrong, my bad. <br /> <br /> The ideas I'm tossing around right now is a sort stoic and lithe guy whom declared Ren. Judge is inconsequential. Guild is either Su-Menent or Mesen-Nebu, haven't really decided and since it's all up in the air I'd like those more versed in MtC to help hammer it out. <br /> <br /> Character concept is &quot;Noble Snake in the Grass&quot;. Unless that doesn't work out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T21:56:16-07:00","id":1528,"title":"","content":"Oh, hey, I didn't mention it before because it didn't occur to me, but can we use the GMC rules changes? It's so ingrained for me anymore that's why it didn't occur to me to even ask before. In which case, I'll assume not quite 20 XP, but more like 10 or so.<br /> <br /> Alright, here are some preliminary ideas:<br /> <br /> Name:<br /> Virtue:<br /> Vice:<br /> Judge: Utu-Nesert<br /> Guild: Mesen-Nebu<br /> Decree: Ba<br /> Concept: Adventurous mummy seeking life throughout deathless ages<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Attributes</b></span><br /> Strength 2<br /> Dexterity 3<br /> Stamina 3<br /> <br /> Intelligence 2<br /> Wits 3<br /> Resolve 3<br /> <br /> Presence 2<br /> Manipulation 1<br /> Composure 3<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Skills</b></span><br /> Academics 1<br /> Computer<br /> Crafts 2<br /> Investigation 2<br /> Medicine<br /> Occult 2<br /> Politics<br /> Science<br /> <br /> Athletics 4 (Acrobatics)<br /> Brawl 2<br /> Drive<br /> Firearms<br /> Larceny 2<br /> Stealth 1<br /> Survival 2<br /> Weaponry<br /> <br /> Animal Ken 1<br /> Empathy 1<br /> Expression 1<br /> Intimidation<br /> Persuasion 1<br /> Socialize<br /> Streetwise<br /> Subterfuge<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Merits</b></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Advantages</b></span><br /> Size: 5<br /> Speed: 12<br /> Defense: 3<br /> Armor: 1/1<br /> Initiative: 6<br /> Health: 8<br /> Willpower: 6<br /> Memory: 3<br /> Sekhem: 10<br /> Pillars: Ab 2, Ba 3, Ka 2, Ren 1, Sheut 1<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Affinities</b></span><br /> Falcon Soul Aloft<br /> Divine Flesh<br /> Running Like Flight (+2 Fleet of Foot, can double Speed when not observed by any other sentient being)<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Utterances</b></span><br /> Command the Beasts<br /> Dust Beneath Feet<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>XP</b></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":109,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","user":"Claire Redfield","date":". 11-03-2013, 04:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T02:00:21-08:00","id":1622,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking someone who was a Logistician in Irem and in previous Descents held some meaningfully important position in a Guild.<br /> <br /> An ardent modernist, he will exploit technologies and techniques new and old to make sure things get from A to B quickly and efficiently. Not particularly sociable as he constantly puts himself as the outside observer, the top down view overall treating people, places and things as little more than resources to move form one place to another, small packets of Dedwen perhaps. Dreams big, <i>very</i> big. He struggles as best he can to remain awake as long as he can, he has to be awake to see his works done but all too often his works are drift away from serving to glorify the Judges and instead becomes extensions of his own ego or just become projects with a momentum of their own and he must watch them through to completion.<br /> <br /> Mesen-Nebu for the Dedwen movement but maybe Tef-Aahbi as he could use Geomantic principles and theories of Heka to build vast sprawling transport networks that follow and funnel the flow of energies across an entire country.<br /> <br /> Int and Wits and probably Academics and Science as big parts of his stats. Interdisciplinary Specialty on Logistics could represent that he views things from the birds eye view and applies logistics solutions to everyday problems.<br /> <br /> Egg. Noble Snake in the grass. Does that mean you'd picture yourself as the spider in the center of their web? Contacts and infomration coming in from everywhere and all you need do is tug on a thread to bring a rival crashing down? Good to be friends with but dangerous to cross.<br /> <br /> Lara Croft as a Mummy, so inverse concepts then, rather than raiding Tombs you populate them!<br /> <br /> I too am a fan of the GMC rules.<br /> <br /> I believe there was a thread on the old forums for some attempts to switch things over. I think they had something like 5xp extra (20 divide by 5), Utterances and Affinities cost 4xp (they used to cost 15 and 20/5 x 4 = 16xp seemed about right).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T02:58:45-08:00","id":1641,"title":"","content":"I'm liking these concepts. I'm also happy to use God Machine Chronicle rules if everyone has them and is familiar with them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T03:55:33-08:00","id":1648,"title":"","content":"If Claire's Mesen-Nebu I'll go for Tef-Aabhi then as either would work thematically and some variety is nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T04:27:51-08:00","id":1654,"title":"","content":"Agreed. I've not against different Guilds being in league. It will provide some enjoyable variety <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T05:05:12-08:00","id":1670,"title":"","content":"If you'd rather we share Guilds I am very happy to be Mesen-Nebu, they're my favourite <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also I am assuming we're only using the corebook or can we grab Affinities and Utterances from Guildhalls? Talismans?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T06:48:43-08:00","id":1712,"title":"","content":"Let's stick to the core book for this one. I imagine the game will be concept heavy so that the players who are new to the game can get the most from the setting in a relatively short time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T08:00:26-08:00","id":1772,"title":"","content":"Ok here we go<br /> <br /> 5 merit points and 2xp to spend.<br /> <br /> <br /> Name:<br /> Virtue: Meticulous<br /> Vice: Ego<br /> Judge: Neheb-Nefert - The Beautiful One<br /> Guild: Tef-Aabhi<br /> Decree: Ba<br /> Concept: Egotistical geomantic logistician<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Aspirations</b></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Attributes</b></span><br /> Strength 2<br /> Dexterity 3<br /> Stamina 2<br /> <br /> Intelligence 4<br /> Wits 3<br /> Resolve 2<br /> <br /> Presence 2<br /> Manipulation 1<br /> Composure 3<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Skills</b></span><br /> Academics 3 (Geography)<br /> Computer<br /> Crafts 2<br /> Investigation 1<br /> Medicine<br /> Occult 2 (Heka)<br /> Politics<br /> Science 3 (Logistics)<br /> <br /> Athletics 2<br /> Brawl 1<br /> Drive<br /> Firearms 1<br /> Larceny 1<br /> Stealth 1<br /> Survival<br /> Weaponry 1<br /> <br /> Animal Ken<br /> Empathy<br /> Expression 1<br /> Intimidation<br /> Persuasion 2<br /> Socialize<br /> Streetwise 1<br /> Subterfuge<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Merits</b></span><br /> Guild Status (Tef-Aabhi) 1<br /> Language 1 (English, French)<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Advantages</b></span><br /> Size: 5<br /> Speed: 10<br /> Defense: 3<br /> Armor: 0/0<br /> Initiative: 6<br /> Health: 7<br /> Willpower: 5<br /> Memory: 3<br /> Sekhem: 10<br /> Pillars: Ab 3, Ba 4 (1xp), Ka 1, Ren 2 (2xp), Sheut 1<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Affinities</b></span><br /> Living In Now<br /> Model Lifeweb<br /> Entombed Glory<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Utterances</b></span><br /> Revelations of Smoke and Flame (near useless but damn is it cool!)<br /> Palace Knows Its Pharaoh","signature":"","edited":{"userid":291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","user":"Scutarii","date":". 11-03-2013, 11:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T08:05:50-08:00","id":1779,"title":"","content":"For Cults and Tombs and such, are we waking up alone or should we have something of those established already?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29