":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T11:45:10-08:00","id":1910,"title":"","content":"Absolutely fine! There's no rush <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T11:51:41-08:00","id":1915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scutarii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1355-mummy-the-curse-pbp-a-curse-upon-paris-discussion-thread?p=1670#post1670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you'd rather we share Guilds I am very happy to be Mesen-Nebu, they're my favourite <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also I am assuming we're only using the corebook or can we grab Affinities and Utterances from Guildhalls? Talismans?</div> </div> </div> </div>What kinds of new Affinities and Utterances do you get? A pretty good selection? What are Talismans like?<br /> <br /> Also, if you wanna share Mesen-Nebu, I'm okay with that. Gives us an in-character hook. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Gentleman, I'm assuming something around 10 XP in the new XP system is closer to 20 in the old (well, possibly not, because the old system was very messed up). How much do you wanna do?<br /> <br /> I don't know if it will be within the scope of this game or not, but Apotheosis interests me greatly as a player and I think interests my character, too, on some level. We'll see.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T13:34:34-08:00","id":1999,"title":"","content":"A lot of the flavour of the Guilds comes through in the Affinities in Guildhalls because the ones in the core book are 'generic' rather than Affinities specialised for doing 'Guild Business'.<br /> <br /> Mesen-Nebu alchemy and transforming Dedwen are in Guildhalls, Tef-Aabhi manipulating Heka is in Guildhalls, Scribes with writing based powers are in Guildhalls etc.<br /> <br /> Talismans are a whole extra layer of complexity so I'd recommend not using them straight away, they are basically a way of ameliorating the effects of losing Sekhem to the Descent but I think that would be distracting early on as the ticking clock element is a big part of Mummy and countering it with Talismans might dull the impact.<br /> <br /> Remember, Apotheosis is Heresy!<br /> <br /> I'm kind of biased in favour of Guildhalls as I wrote about half the errata thread on the old WW forums so I know it fine toothed comb style :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T14:31:31-08:00","id":2052,"title":"","content":"Alright, were we go. I'm not hyper familiar with the GMC, but I do have it open in front of me <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Leaving the Merits mostly blank cause I'm not sure how many Merit Points GMC dolls out at chargen and what's going on with Cult/Tombs/etc.<br /> <br /> If I got anything wrong---specifically in Affinities or Utterances---let me know. <hr /><br /> <b>Name</b>:<br /> <b>Virtue</b>: Loyal<br /> <b>Vice</b>: Resentful<br /> <b>Judge</b>: Tem-Sepu<br /> <b>Guild</b>: Su-Menent<br /> <b>Decree</b>: Ren<br /> <b>Concep</b>t: Noble snake-in-the-grass<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Attributes </span></b><br /> <br /> <b>Strength</b> 1<br /> <b>Dexterity</b> 3<br /> <b>Stamina</b> 2<br /> <br /> <b>Intelligence</b> 3<br /> <b>Wits</b> 3<br /> <b>Resolve</b> 2<br /> <br /> <b>Presence</b> 3<br /> <b>Manipulation</b> 4<br /> <b>Composure</b> 2<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Skills</b></span><br /> <b>Academics </b>2 (Funeray Rites)<br /> <b>Computer<br /> Crafts<br /> Investigation </b>2<br /> <b>Medicine </b>1<br /> <b>Occult </b>1<br /> <b>Politics<br /> Science </b>2<br /> <br /> <b>Athletics<br /> Brawl<br /> Drive<br /> Firearms<br /> Larceny<br /> Stealth </b>3<br /> <b>Survival<br /> Weaponry </b>2 (Knives)<br /> <br /> <b>Animal Ken<br /> Empathy </b>2<br /> <b>Expression </b>1<br /> <b>Intimidation </b>1<br /> <b>Persuasion</b> 3<br /> <b>Socialize</b> 2<br /> <b>Streetwise<br /> Subterfuge </b>3 (Lying)<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Merits</b></span><br /> <b>Language </b>1 (English, French)<br /> <b>Guild Status </b>1 (Su-Menent)<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Advantages</b></span><br /> <b>Size: </b>5<br /> <b>Speed: </b>10<br /> <b>Defense: </b>3<br /> <b>Armor:</b> 0/0<br /> <b>Initiative: </b>6<br /> <b>Health: </b>7<br /> <b>Willpower: </b>4<br /> <b>Memory: </b>3<br /> <b>Sekhem: </b>9<br /> <b>Pillars: Ab </b>1 <b>Ba</b> 2 <b>Ka</b> 1 <b>Ren </b>4 <b>Sheut</b> 3<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Affinities</b></span><br /> Charmed Lives<br /> Fated Soul<br /> Night Creature<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Utterances</b></span><br /> Awaken the Dead<br /> Rite of the Sacred Scarab","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":245,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","user":"Egg","date":". 11-03-2013, 06:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T15:01:15-08:00","id":2076,"title":"","content":"Wonderful!<br /> In the way of XP, let's defer to generosity and say 12XP to spend at character generation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T15:21:40-08:00","id":2098,"title":"","content":"Alrighty! I went back and edited my &quot;sheet&quot; to reflect that. In summary:<ul><li>3 merit points were given up for an additional dot in Ba</li> <li>6 XP was spent on adding a dot to Stealth, Medicine, and Expression</li> <li>2 XP was spent on adding a dot to Ren</li> <li>4 XP was spent on adding a dot to Wits</li> </ul>I still have 2 merit points I believe, but do not really know what to use them on","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T17:09:26-08:00","id":2186,"title":"","content":"As of the GMC-era changes, supernatural beings start with 10 Merit dots, if that matters here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T18:32:34-08:00","id":2269,"title":"","content":"So then that leaves me....5 merit points free I reckon. Could I use four of those on a cult for Mummy and get like, a Reach of 2?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T23:30:30-08:00","id":2434,"title":"","content":"Yes indeed! With regards to cults, this is perhaps where we should do some mutual planning. The game is set in Paris, so it's unlikely you have anything particularly tribal (unless you're going the incestuous family route) but beyond that, would the three of you like to share an expansive cult or have different cults that work in concert with each other when convenient?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T00:07:05-08:00","id":2447,"title":"","content":"I was considering running an Enterprise cult, they do road building and transport projects, only the upper echelons and some few low level members of the Enterprise are inducted and the majority are simply working for a private company. Depending on Reach they'll either be working local to Paris or they'll be working all across France. Grasp will almost certainly be low. The are set projects by me to lobby government frequently to allow them to build roads and rails and such that, once all connected, will cover Paris/France in one vast geomantic grid.<br /> <br /> For a Tomb I was going to have a fairly large one. Geometry 3+ for example.<br /> <br /> But if we're a closely knit Meret we could even sare that and share cults. But as we don't really remember much we can work out <i>why</i> that is the case in play <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T06:41:10-08:00","id":2564,"title":"","content":"I'm leaning towards more three individual cults that work with each other when needed, but you're the boss; so whichever you feel would help us new to MtC get a good grasp on things would be fine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T09:40:19-08:00","id":2696,"title":"","content":"With three players we could cover each type of Cult. Tribal (as suggested an incestuous family could work), Enterprise and Conspiracy (perhaps the rich elite of the city, in a throwback to Louix the Sun King and masquerade balls).<br /> <br /> Also I've got some XP and Merits to apply. 2/10 merits spent so far and 3/12 XP.<br /> <br /> I'll set aside 6 merits for reach 3 Enterprise Cult, 2 for Tomb Geomancy and maybe some XP for it too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T12:45:58-08:00","id":2839,"title":"","content":"I'm fine with my Mummy having the potential Tribal cult, if that's okay with Claire and GG","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T12:57:17-08:00","id":2844,"title":"","content":"Apparently I can't edit the old post anymore.<br /> <br /> Name: Akheoekare - The Builder of Roads<br /> Virtue: Meticulous<br /> Vice: Ego<br /> Judge: Neheb-Nefert - The Beautiful One<br /> Guild: Tef-Aabhi<br /> Decree: Ba<br /> Concept: Egotistical geomantic logistician<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Aspirations</b></span><br /> Finish my geomantic grid - long term<br /> Fulfill my first purpose - mid term<br /> Find my Meret - short term<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Attributes</b></span><br /> Strength 2<br /> Dexterity 3<br /> Stamina 2<br /> <br /> Intelligence 4<br /> Wits 3<br /> Resolve 2<br /> <br /> Presence 2<br /> Manipulation 1<br /> Composure 3<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Skills</b></span><br /> Academics 2 (Geography)<br /> Computer<br /> Crafts 2<br /> Investigation 1<br /> Medicine<br /> Occult 3 (Heka)<br /> Politics<br /> Science 3 (Logistics)<br /> <br /> Athletics 2<br /> Brawl 2<br /> Drive<br /> Firearms<br /> Larceny 1<br /> Stealth 1<br /> Survival<br /> Weaponry 1<br /> <br /> Animal Ken<br /> Empathy<br /> Expression 1<br /> Intimidation<br /> Persuasion 2<br /> Socialize<br /> Streetwise 1<br /> Subterfuge<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Merits</b></span><br /> Guild Status (Tef-Aabhi) 3 (2xp)<br /> Language 1 (English, French)<br /> Cult: Reach 2 Grasp 0, 4<br /> Tomb (Geomancy 3) 2 +1xp<br /> Area of Expertise: Heka 1<br /> Interdisciplinary Specialty: Heka 1<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Advantages</b></span><br /> Size: 5<br /> Speed: 10<br /> Defense: 5<br /> Armor: 0/0<br /> Initiative: 6<br /> Health: 7<br /> Willpower: 5<br /> Memory: 3<br /> Sekhem: 10<br /> Pillars: Ab 3, Ba 4 (1xp), Ka 3 (4xp), Ren 2 (2xp), Sheut 2 (2xp)<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Affinities</b></span><br /> Living In Now<br /> Model Lifeweb<br /> Dominating Might<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#DAA520\"><b>Utterances</b></span><br /> Revelations of Smoke and Flame (near useless but damn is it cool!)<br /> Palace Knows Its Pharaoh","signature":"","edited":{"userid":291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","user":"Scutarii","date":". 11-04-2013, 04:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T00:47:09-08:00","id":3260,"title":"","content":"That would be excellent for me, from a Storyteller's perspective. It means you can use different types of cults / cultists to achieve different things. Okay.. Characters are largely built. Does anyone have any questions before we start? Much of the rest can be picked up as we play, and we can continue to use this thread as an OOC zone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T01:30:10-08:00","id":3276,"title":"","content":"How recently/frequently have we been awake?<br /> <br /> Are we mystified by computers? Is a digital mobile device world new while we understand green text on black screens? Would we recognise Hitler? Or are we remembering fondly the defeat of the Kaiser? At Memory 3 we remember important fragments of our last Descent and not much else - what/when was our last Descent?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-05T03:22:57-08:00","id":3338,"title":"","content":"Each of your three Arisen were last active during the Great War and the early '20s, desperately attempting to protect your cul